      "sweden/stockholm-gamla-stan": {
        "name": "Gamla Stan, the Royal Palace and Vasa Museum",
        "description": "The medieval island old town, the royal palace and a 17th-century warship raised from the sea.",
        "details": "Gamla Stan has cobbled lanes and the Stortorget square. The Royal Palace has the changing of the guard. The Vasa Museum on Djurgarden holds a nearly intact warship that sank on her maiden voyage in 1628. Allow half a day for each.",
