        "name": "Stockholm archipelago boat trip",
        "description": "A ferry through thousands of islands, with swimming, fika and summer houses.",
        "details": "The Stockholm archipelago has about 30,000 islands. Waxholm boats serve the inner islands such as Vaxholm and Grinda. In summer you can swim and picnic. Take a coffee and cinnamon bun (fika) with you.",
        "interests": [
          "relax",
