        "name": "Abisko northern lights and Sky Station",
        "description": "A dark-sky national park with a mountain station for aurora viewing.",
        "details": "Abisko has a famously clear microclimate for northern lights, from September to March. The Aurora Sky Station reached by chairlift is a viewing platform. In summer the midnight sun allows hikes along the Kungsleden trail. Dress in layers.",
